      "raw": "<p>i heared errata pack will at oct 2018.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>maybe 6th print is no error <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;foreign-language localization.</span></p>\r\n<p>i have 2 question.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1.i already have spirit island / b&amp;c in asia. how to i get errata pack?</p>\r\n<p>2.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;foreign-language localization problem is will fix 6th edition?&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
