      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-19T13:02:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;kazaasaky&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"kazaasaky\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>1.i already have spirit island / b&amp;c in asia. how to i get errata pack?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Last I heard, GtG was still trying to figure out how to provide it outside the US at a reasonable cost. Maybe someone will chime in with more recent information. (Which printing do you have?)</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;kazaasaky&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"kazaasaky\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>foreign-language localization problem is will fix 6th edition?</li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I’m not sure whether you’re asking about the 6th printing in English, or the printings in foreign languages. The 6th English printing of the base game should have the issues fixed. (Of course there are always a few typos.)</p>\n<p>My understanding is that the issues were caught just in time to fix things for the foreign-language editions, so they should all be based off of correct text. But I’m not positive. (Of course translation can introduce its own issues, I’m sure you’re familiar with that.)</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:15.170Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
