      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"kazaasaky\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/e68b1a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kazaasaky:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I forgot where to find out how to check my version in errata</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Here you go:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.bu6ocbc\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Querki: Loading Spirit Island FAQ...</a></p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"kazaasaky\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/e68b1a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kazaasaky:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>i wonder about when 6th print is release.&nbsp; foreign-language version is release same time?(with 6th print)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I’m not sure about the 6th printing. Sometime before December, I think?</p>\n<p>Here’s the information I have about foreign-language releases:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.9v5kcg9\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.9v5kcg9</a></p>\n<p>It varies, depending on the language, and there may be more in the works. Which language are you most interested in?</p>",
